0..63 Comment "// An omitted model implicit at a manifest model type resolved:"
64..139 Comment "// `[s : Model(Dial) with sort C = Integer]` binds no parameter for `C`, so"
140..211 Comment "// no argument forces it, and the sort the type fixes is what tells the"
212..290 Comment "// modules in scope apart. `Up` counts integers and `Flips` flags; only `Up`\'s"
291..366 Comment "// carrier is the one the slot fixes, so a call leaving the slot out passes"
367..375 Comment "// `Up`."
376..378 Comment "//"
379..394 Comment "// - see: #2317"
